WEBVTT

01:31.500 --> 01:33.100
Shou!

01:33.500 --> 01:35.100
Shou!

01:36.500 --> 01:38.500
Come out, Mountain God!

01:49.500 --> 01:51.500
What did you do that for?

01:51.500 --> 01:56.500
It's you. Aren't you the fairy maiden
who's in charge of brewing wine?

01:56.500 --> 01:59.500
What are you doing
on this remote land?

01:59.500 --> 02:04.500
Mei Shouquan and I were passing by.
Why did you make trouble for us?

02:04.500 --> 02:07.100
Do you want him dead?

02:07.100 --> 02:13.500
Did he purposely come here to break gas
and ruin my territory's aura?

02:13.500 --> 02:14.500
Gas?

02:16.500 --> 02:18.500
Gas derives from the five cereals

02:18.500 --> 02:23.100
If you can't even stand such a trivial
thing, how will you be an immortal?

02:23.100 --> 02:28.500
Trivial thing? Look at my bird!
It's turned into a "bat"!

02:28.500 --> 02:30.500
Indeed it stinks!

02:32.500 --> 02:36.500
If he's offended you,
I'll apologize on his behalf

02:36.500 --> 02:41.100
I know he didn't do it on purpose.
He just didn't want to be rude to me

02:41.500 --> 02:48.100
Does that mean he could be rude
to me and could knock my bird out?

02:48.500 --> 02:52.500
On account that we're going to the
Eastern Sea to find the furnace...

02:52.500 --> 02:55.500
to save lives,
please spare him

02:56.100 --> 02:59.500
Shut up! No more nonsense!
Make way!

02:59.500 --> 03:02.500
-What are you trying to do?
-I'll teach him a lesson!

03:02.500 --> 03:03.500
I dare you to do that!

03:03.500 --> 03:07.100
Get out of my way or
I'll punish you too!

03:07.500 --> 03:09.500
All right, go ahead

03:09.500 --> 03:15.500
I'll tell the Queen Mother you abused
your powers because of a trivial matter

03:15.500 --> 03:17.100
I'll fly to...

03:17.100 --> 03:19.100
Don't...!

03:19.500 --> 03:24.500
Let me revive my bird
before I settle my scores with you!

03:26.500 --> 03:27.500
Shou!

03:28.500 --> 03:32.100
Are you all right, Shou?
Wake up!

03:32.100 --> 03:35.100
What happened, Ruyi?
How did I get here?

03:35.300 --> 03:37.300
There was an earthquake

03:37.500 --> 03:42.100
I remember something was jolting

03:42.500 --> 03:44.500
Everything's fine now.
Let's go

03:47.500 --> 03:50.100
What's the stink?

03:51.500 --> 03:54.500
-Where are we?
-I don't know...

03:56.500 --> 03:59.500
Sorry I didn't even
save a drop for you

04:02.500 --> 04:04.500
I thought my wide knowledge...

04:04.500 --> 04:08.500
would allow me to travel round
the world without any difficulty

04:08.500 --> 04:10.500
But I was wrong

04:10.500 --> 04:14.500
However much flair I have for literature,
I can't get us any water

04:14.500 --> 04:17.500
From now on, don't treat me as
a princess anymore

04:18.500 --> 04:20.500
I don't think that's a good idea

04:21.500 --> 04:26.100
At a difficult time like this,
we should share weal and woe

04:31.500 --> 04:34.300
What's the matter with you?

04:39.380 --> 04:41.380
Nothing.
We'll share weal and woe

05:05.500 --> 05:07.500
I want water!

05:10.500 --> 05:12.500
I want water...

05:25.500 --> 05:27.100
What is it?

05:28.100 --> 05:29.500
A cactus

05:30.500 --> 05:34.100
-Is it poisonous?
-We're saved!

05:37.500 --> 05:39.500
What do you mean?

05:39.500 --> 05:42.500
The cactus juice will
quench our thirst

05:44.500 --> 05:47.500
How do you expect me to eat this?!

05:47.500 --> 05:50.500
This is the only thing
which can save us

05:54.500 --> 05:58.300
No doubt about it!
It's a big piece!

06:09.500 --> 06:12.100
It's safe for drinking

06:14.500 --> 06:16.500
It tastes awful

06:24.300 --> 06:26.500
-What's the matter?
-The smell is horrible

06:26.500 --> 06:31.500
Still, you must drink it.
Just imagine it's snow pear or lychee

06:31.500 --> 06:33.500
Use your imagination...

06:33.500 --> 06:35.500
We must be philosophical
and optimistic...

06:35.500 --> 06:40.100
in order to overcome every obstacle
and get ourselves out of this mess

06:40.500 --> 06:44.500
It's because I was optimistic that
I thought you could...

06:44.500 --> 06:47.500
get me back to the Capital
on a kite

06:47.500 --> 06:49.500
But now we're stuck here

06:50.500 --> 06:55.500
The unexpected always happen. I didn't
anticipate the change in wind directions

06:56.500 --> 07:02.100
You're right. The unexpected always
happen in nature as well as in life

07:02.500 --> 07:05.100
That means we're going to die here...

07:06.500 --> 07:10.500
Don't lose heart, Your Highness.
We mustn't think of death

07:10.500 --> 07:14.100
Instead, we should think of
how to live on

07:14.500 --> 07:17.500
Just be optimistic and philosophical

07:21.500 --> 07:24.500
I want to be philosophical
and optimistic!

07:24.500 --> 07:26.100
Try

07:28.100 --> 07:31.100
I want to be philosophical and...

07:32.500 --> 07:36.500
Your Highness...!

07:43.500 --> 07:46.100
Are you all right, Your Highness?

07:48.100 --> 07:50.100
Look at you!

07:51.500 --> 07:53.500
-You're filthy
-So are you

08:56.500 --> 08:58.500
Smells great.
Have a bite

08:59.500 --> 09:01.500
I don't want it

09:02.100 --> 09:06.500
Why? You should be thankful
to have vulture meat to eat

09:07.500 --> 09:11.500
If you don't eat, how will you
have the energy to move on?

09:12.500 --> 09:14.500
I just have no appetite!

09:15.500 --> 09:21.100
Just imagine it's roast chicken
or barbecued duck,

09:21.100 --> 09:23.100
and it'll taste good

09:23.500 --> 09:28.500
The last time we had cactus juice,
you wanted me to use my imagination

09:28.500 --> 09:33.500
And now you want me to do it again.
No, I won't! I'd rather starve to death!

09:37.500 --> 09:39.500
You really won't eat it?

09:47.500 --> 09:51.300
Why did you throw it away?
Even if I don't eat it, you should

09:51.500 --> 09:57.100
I said that we'd share weal and woe.
So I'll starve with you

09:57.100 --> 09:59.100
We'll die together

09:59.100 --> 10:01.100
Don't push me

10:02.100 --> 10:04.100
All right, I'll eat it

10:06.500 --> 10:09.100
It doesn't taste that bad, right?

10:11.100 --> 10:15.100
Don't disturb me. I'm trying to imagine
myself taking a full-course mutton feast

10:23.500 --> 10:25.300
What's the matter?

10:29.500 --> 10:34.300
It's stiff and stringy!
My teeth hurt!

10:34.500 --> 10:40.300
Please bear with it and eat it up.
We need something to give us energy

10:44.300 --> 10:47.300
Hush...
Do you feel sorry for the vulture?

10:49.500 --> 10:54.500
It was flying in the sky,
but now it's become roast meat

10:54.500 --> 10:56.500
No...

11:00.300 --> 11:01.500
What is it then?

11:01.500 --> 11:05.300
I feel sorry for myself...!

11:05.500 --> 11:08.500
-I'm a princess
-Indeed you are

11:08.500 --> 11:12.500
Yet here I am eating cactus
and vulture meat!

11:12.500 --> 11:15.500
I should be living in comfort
in the palace!

11:15.500 --> 11:16.500
Indeed

11:26.500 --> 11:30.100
You have to put aside
your status as Princess

11:31.500 --> 11:35.500
Given the state we're in,
we must try to save ourselves

11:36.100 --> 11:39.100
I'm not someone who
can't take hardship

11:39.500 --> 11:45.300
When I set off,
I was prepared to suffer

11:45.500 --> 11:51.100
But I didn't expect to
end up in a desert...!

11:52.300 --> 11:54.500
I miss my father...

11:54.500 --> 11:58.500
If I don't get out of the desert,
I'll never see him again...!

12:01.500 --> 12:03.500
Don't be so pessimistic

12:03.500 --> 12:08.100
I give you my word that I'll see you
safely back to the Capital!

12:09.100 --> 12:13.500
You give me your word?
You can't even fend for yourself

12:13.500 --> 12:16.500
Do you think you're
some immortal reincarnated?

12:16.500 --> 12:20.500
If you have faith, we'll make it!

12:21.500 --> 12:26.500
There isn't a soul in the vicinity.
How can there possibly be miracles?

12:31.300 --> 12:32.300
Look!

12:34.500 --> 12:36.500
Look! A shooting star!

12:37.500 --> 12:40.500
-Oh no, I'm doomed!
-What's the matter?

12:40.500 --> 12:45.500
According to the astrologers
in the palace, a falling star means...

12:45.500 --> 12:50.500
someone will disappear from
the surface of the earth!

12:50.500 --> 12:52.500
That's not true!

12:53.500 --> 12:57.100
The merchants from the western regions
told me if you make a wish...

12:57.100 --> 13:00.100
upon seeing a shooting star,
your wish will come true

13:00.500 --> 13:02.500
-Really?
-Yes

13:03.500 --> 13:06.100
-What are you doing?
-Making a wish!

13:06.500 --> 13:08.500
But there isn't any shooting star now

13:10.500 --> 13:12.300
Another one!

13:19.500 --> 13:21.500
What wish did you make?

13:21.500 --> 13:28.100
That I could have a bath.
I haven't bathed for days. I stink!

13:28.500 --> 13:33.100
Even if I must die, I must go to the
netherworld looking neat and clean

14:13.100 --> 14:18.100
Oh Heaven, you're really cruel

14:36.500 --> 14:39.500
It's snowing heavily!

15:07.500 --> 15:08.500
Your Highness...

15:16.500 --> 15:19.500
-What are you doing?
-I've found something

15:19.500 --> 15:22.500
-I'm not going
-Come on, do have a look!

15:25.500 --> 15:28.500
-What is it?
-Don't you want to bathe? Come with me

15:28.500 --> 15:32.100
Can I possibly bathe here?
Stop having me on!

15:33.100 --> 15:34.100
Water!

15:36.300 --> 15:37.300
Water!

15:38.500 --> 15:40.500
Surprised?

15:40.500 --> 15:42.500
How did you do it?

15:43.500 --> 15:47.100
I told you - if you have faith,
we'll make it

15:47.500 --> 15:49.500
My wish has come true!

15:50.500 --> 15:52.500
Want to know where
the water came from?

15:52.500 --> 15:58.500
While you were asleep last night,
it snowed and the snow melted in my hands

15:59.100 --> 16:02.100
So I quickly dug a hole
to collect it

16:02.100 --> 16:05.100
It turned into water
when the sun came out

16:06.500 --> 16:08.500
You stayed up the whole night?

16:10.500 --> 16:14.500
Never mind. I'll catch some sleep
while you bathe

16:14.500 --> 16:18.100
Let me teach you a method.
It's called sand bath

16:18.100 --> 16:24.100
Rub some sand on yourself
and rinse with water

16:25.500 --> 16:31.100
This will remove all the dead skin.
Let me help you...

16:35.500 --> 16:38.100
I'm going to sleep.
You bathe

17:24.500 --> 17:28.500
No, I'm an educated man.
How can I peep at her?

17:28.500 --> 17:30.500
Just this once!

17:34.300 --> 17:39.300
No... See no evil, hear no evil,
speak no evil. What if she finds out?

17:40.500 --> 17:43.100
Nobody's going to tell her!

17:51.100 --> 17:53.100
No...
Only a hooligan peeps at others

17:54.500 --> 17:59.500
Who will tell her I'm a hooligan?
Nobody, right? I worry too much!

18:06.300 --> 18:11.300
I just can't do it!
That's why I'm running to and fro

18:12.500 --> 18:16.500
But whatever for?
I'm young, and I'm not a saint!

18:32.500 --> 18:36.500
I guess once we're out of the desert,
we'll reach the Eastern Sea

18:36.500 --> 18:40.100
You mean we're nearing our destination?
That's great!

18:40.500 --> 18:44.500
Don't rejoice too soon. This desert
stretches for a thousand li

18:44.500 --> 18:48.100
It's scorching hot in the day
and freezing cold at night

18:48.100 --> 18:51.100
We might die here
if we're not careful!

18:51.100 --> 18:52.500
Are you scared?

18:53.500 --> 18:57.500
You think too little of me.
I've been around

18:57.500 --> 19:00.500
A small desert doesn't daunt me

19:01.500 --> 19:03.100
Scared?

19:03.500 --> 19:06.500
Not with you around.
I'm most scared of you

19:06.500 --> 19:09.500
When did you become
as glib as Wu Fuqi?

19:09.500 --> 19:13.100
Don't hit me.
Which way should we go?

19:15.100 --> 19:16.500
This way

19:25.500 --> 19:29.500
This is strange. According to the map,
we should've reached the sea

19:29.500 --> 19:34.300
But it's nowhere in sight.
There isn't even a drop of water

19:35.500 --> 19:39.500
Maybe the sea is just up ahead.
Let's move on

19:40.500 --> 19:43.500
I'm afraid I might have
interpreted the map wrongly

19:44.500 --> 19:48.100
Sorry, I didn't mean to make you
walk all the way here for nothing

19:48.500 --> 19:51.500
I certainly hope what you said
isn't true

19:51.500 --> 19:53.500
But don't worry

19:53.500 --> 19:58.500
Having walked for so many days,
I feel I'm fitter and stronger

19:58.500 --> 20:02.100
I can go on for another three days
and three nights!

20:02.500 --> 20:06.500
But before we move on,
we must decide which way to go

20:06.500 --> 20:07.500
That way?

20:09.500 --> 20:11.500
Are you all right?

20:12.500 --> 20:14.500
Yes. Don't worry about me

20:15.500 --> 20:18.100
You're just comforting me

20:28.500 --> 20:30.500
-Want some water?
-You go ahead

20:41.500 --> 20:47.100
What a thing to find in this desert.
There are some patterns on it

20:50.500 --> 20:52.500
For you, Ruyi

20:54.300 --> 20:56.300
Why are you giving it to me?

20:56.500 --> 21:03.100
No reason. It's common for
a man to give a woman a gift

21:04.500 --> 21:07.500
Since you don't want it,
I'll throw it away

21:08.500 --> 21:12.500
I didn't say I didn't want it. Since you
mean to give it to me, I'll accept it

21:14.100 --> 21:15.100
Thanks

21:18.500 --> 21:21.500
-What is this?
-What? Isn't it a stone?

21:22.100 --> 21:24.100
It's a fossil of a conch!

21:24.100 --> 21:26.100
What's that?

21:27.500 --> 21:29.500
-It is a fossil of a conch!
-So?

21:29.500 --> 21:32.500
Look around for more!

21:36.500 --> 21:39.500
I've found one more!

21:40.500 --> 21:43.500
There are a lot!

21:47.500 --> 21:51.500
I'm so dull. Being in the mortal world,
I actually forgot that I'd seen...

21:51.500 --> 21:54.500
the Eastern Sea turn into land
three times

21:54.500 --> 22:00.100
This desert could very well
be where the Eastern Sea was!

22:00.100 --> 22:03.500
What are you mumbling about?
I've found many more fossils

22:03.500 --> 22:05.500
Shou, we're in the Eastern Sea!

22:06.500 --> 22:08.500
We are? Surely not?

22:08.500 --> 22:11.100
It's true!
We are in the Eastern Sea!

22:12.500 --> 22:18.100
If this land didn't use to be a sea,
there wouldn't be so many conch fossils!

22:25.300 --> 22:27.500
We've reached the Eastern Sea!

22:29.500 --> 22:33.300
-So where's the furnace?
-Under the sand!

22:33.300 --> 22:36.500
Let's find it then!
Which spot is it under?

22:36.500 --> 22:38.500
I don't know!

22:38.500 --> 22:43.100
This place is vast.
How are we going to look for it?

22:45.500 --> 22:48.100
How will we find the furnace?

22:57.500 --> 22:59.500
Sorry, I got carried away

23:01.300 --> 23:02.500
What's the matter?

23:02.500 --> 23:07.100
We've come to the edge of the east.
But the cave is still nowhere in sight

23:07.500 --> 23:10.500
Could we have taken
the wrong way again?

23:10.500 --> 23:15.500
It can't be. We headed east,
where the sun comes out from

23:15.500 --> 23:17.500
This should be where the cave is

23:17.500 --> 23:21.500
Maybe we haven't reached there yet.
Let's move on

23:22.500 --> 23:24.500
-This way
-But it's so high!

23:40.500 --> 23:42.100
This way?

23:42.500 --> 23:45.500
I'm sure if we go this way,
we'll be able to get out of here

24:01.500 --> 24:05.500
Buns again.
I'm sick of them

24:05.500 --> 24:08.500
Take it or leave it.
There's nothing else for you

24:08.500 --> 24:14.500
I really miss the noodles and buns
in Ping'an Town. Oh, I'm drooling...

24:15.500 --> 24:18.300
We don't live for the sake of eating

24:18.300 --> 24:21.300
-Let me take a break
-Many tasks are awaiting you!

24:21.500 --> 24:26.500
How can I think of my ideals when I'm
hungry? I have to fill my stomach first

24:26.500 --> 24:30.500
Nobody's asking you to starve.
You at least have buns to eat

24:34.500 --> 24:37.500
Life isn't just about buns!
I need to lie down!

24:39.100 --> 24:42.100
We don't live just
for the sake of eating!

24:42.100 --> 24:46.500
People who cultivate their minds to
become immortals don't even eat buns

24:46.500 --> 24:49.500
They only live on fruit
and spring water

24:51.500 --> 24:56.100
I can go without food, but I
don't want to become an immortal!

24:56.500 --> 25:00.500
My mother wants me to get a wife and
have children to carry on the family line

25:02.500 --> 25:06.500
It's only right that one gets a wife!
I must get a wife!

25:06.500 --> 25:11.500
But you're not an ordinary man.
You need to have more lofty dreams!

25:11.500 --> 25:15.500
I am an ordinary man!
What nonsense are you talking about?

25:15.500 --> 25:20.500
No, you're not! You must do what
you should before you turn 30!

25:20.500 --> 25:24.500
The thing I must do before I turn 30
is to get a wife!

25:25.500 --> 25:26.500
Understand?

25:27.500 --> 25:29.500
How can I make you see my point?

25:54.500 --> 25:56.500
The wind is blowing again

25:59.500 --> 26:01.500
What now?

26:06.500 --> 26:09.500
Let's fly again

26:17.500 --> 26:23.100
I feel I've grown up. I'm no longer
the princess living in clover

26:26.500 --> 26:30.500
You're right. If we have faith,
we'll overcome all difficulties

26:31.500 --> 26:34.500
I'm really happy to hear that

26:35.500 --> 26:41.100
You know, I was actually quite
worried when we were in the desert

26:41.500 --> 26:45.100
I was afraid we might never
get out of it alive

26:45.500 --> 26:50.500
But I didn't want to worry you. That
was why I said that to encourage you

26:50.500 --> 26:55.300
In any case,
thanks, Master Wei!

26:56.500 --> 27:03.500
Don't say that. Actually, you were
the one who gave me courage to move on

27:04.500 --> 27:09.300
We could get out of the desert
because we helped each other

27:11.500 --> 27:17.300
We're out of danger!
Thanks for watching over us, Heaven!

27:17.500 --> 27:20.300
You do that too

27:22.500 --> 27:24.500
Thank you, Heaven!

27:25.500 --> 27:31.500
At last, I'm seeing the Princess
back to the Capital!

27:36.500 --> 27:39.500
Why are there words on it?
When did you write them?

27:39.500 --> 27:41.500
While you were asleep

27:42.500 --> 27:44.500
We had no brush or ink.
How did you do it?

27:44.500 --> 27:48.100
Simple. I used twigs and
cactus juice to write

27:48.100 --> 27:50.100
Aren't you smart!

27:50.500 --> 27:57.100
"Riding the waves, we hoist the sails
and cross the seas"

27:57.500 --> 28:01.500
"Eyes raised, I see the moon so bright,
Head bent, in homesickness I'm drowned"

28:03.500 --> 28:07.100
Rise! Quick, rise!

28:43.500 --> 28:47.100
Are you all right, Your Highness?
Let's move on

28:49.500 --> 28:52.500
Oh no...
I think I've broken my leg

28:52.500 --> 28:58.100
I'll have a look. There's a cave
up ahead. Let's rest inside

29:07.300 --> 29:12.300
Dragon on the left, tiger on the right.
This should be the place

29:16.500 --> 29:20.500
Get up! This should be where
the legendary furnace is!

29:20.500 --> 29:23.500
-I want to sleep a while more!
-No!

29:23.500 --> 29:26.500
Help! I want to sleep!

29:28.500 --> 29:31.100
Fine! I'll look for it myself!

29:47.500 --> 29:49.500
I can't figure it out

29:53.100 --> 29:55.100
What's going on?

29:55.500 --> 29:59.500
Shou! I'm sinking!

30:01.500 --> 30:04.500
Come and join me in the fun!

30:08.500 --> 30:09.500
Ruyi!

30:09.500 --> 30:11.500
Come on, Shou!

30:11.500 --> 30:16.500
Don't move! This is quicksand!
Give me your hand!

30:19.500 --> 30:24.100
Don't exert any force
or you'll sink even faster!

30:26.500 --> 30:27.500
Catch!

30:27.500 --> 30:29.500
-Why?
-I must save you!

30:29.500 --> 30:34.100
-Why are you panicking?
-Don't let go or you'll sink and die!

30:34.500 --> 30:39.500
Hold on tight! Don't let go!
I almost got you!

30:47.500 --> 30:50.500
-You dragged me into it!
-What now?

30:52.500 --> 30:54.100
Shou!

30:54.500 --> 30:58.500
Don't move! The more you move or
use force, the faster you sink!

31:02.300 --> 31:04.300
Never did I dream I'd die here

31:06.100 --> 31:11.500
Before I die,
I'd like to tell you a secret

31:11.500 --> 31:13.100
What is it?

31:13.500 --> 31:16.500
Though we weren't born
on the same day in the same year,

31:17.500 --> 31:20.500
I don't want to die with you
on the same day in the same year

31:21.500 --> 31:24.500
I'd rather die in your place!

31:26.500 --> 31:32.500
Tell you what. You'll step on me
and climb out of the quicksand

31:32.500 --> 31:36.100
It's better for one person to die
than two!

31:36.500 --> 31:38.500
I'll go down first

31:39.500 --> 31:41.500
I just can't go down

31:43.500 --> 31:45.500
We've reached the bottom!

31:45.500 --> 31:48.500
You're right.
It's so shallow

31:50.500 --> 31:52.500
Great! We won't have to die!

31:55.500 --> 31:59.500
-But how do we get out of the sand?
-How would I know?

32:00.500 --> 32:02.100
Go to sleep!

32:02.500 --> 32:06.100
Sure! That was what I was doing
before you got me over

32:06.100 --> 32:09.500
Let's get some sleep before
we think of a way to get out

32:27.500 --> 32:31.100
Where are we?
Put me down

32:38.500 --> 32:40.500
You'd better put me down

32:40.500 --> 32:43.500
No. I prefer to carry you

32:46.500 --> 32:48.500
There are some characters on the wall

32:52.500 --> 32:56.500
"Forbidden ground. Leave quick".
We'd better get out of here!

32:56.500 --> 32:58.500
This is probably a prank

33:01.500 --> 33:03.500
Why did you do that?

33:03.500 --> 33:07.100
Nothing happened.
This is just to scare people off

33:07.500 --> 33:10.500
This place is eerie.
We'd better go

33:10.500 --> 33:12.100
Just a minute

33:13.500 --> 33:15.500
What are you trying to do now?

33:15.500 --> 33:18.100
It'd be a pity not to
write a poem on it

33:23.500 --> 33:28.500
"A traveller returning from the world
only to roam the world again"

33:28.500 --> 33:31.500
"Wei Delu and Princess Ruining
were here"

33:38.100 --> 33:41.100
Let's go!
This place is going to collapse!

33:43.500 --> 33:46.100
I was hit!
Run!

35:16.300 --> 35:21.500
That's just our imagination.
It's not real

35:21.500 --> 35:24.100
It's a mirage

35:29.500 --> 35:32.500
Don't believe in what you see

35:34.500 --> 35:36.500
Believe me

35:40.500 --> 35:44.500
If that were a real camel,
we'd be saved

35:47.500 --> 35:52.500
If that were a real camel,
we could eat its meat,

35:53.100 --> 35:56.100
and use its hide as clothes

35:57.500 --> 36:02.500
Most importantly, it can tell
directions and get us out of here

36:04.500 --> 36:08.500
But that is just an illusion.
See, it's moving

36:09.500 --> 36:11.500
Never mind about it

36:12.500 --> 36:17.500
Our illusion is coming over.
It's walking towards us

36:17.500 --> 36:19.300
Ignore it

36:25.500 --> 36:28.300
It's not real...

36:36.500 --> 36:39.500
Your Highness, I have a feeling...

36:40.500 --> 36:43.500
it's real

36:50.500 --> 36:53.900
The camel!
Go after it!

37:17.500 --> 37:20.500
Which way?

37:20.500 --> 37:21.500
Where?

38:17.500 --> 38:19.500
Oh no, I think he's fallen for me!

38:20.500 --> 38:23.300
No! I mustn't let it happen!

38:25.500 --> 38:29.500
She knows I fancy her.
Why does she keep me at a distance?

38:29.500 --> 38:31.500
Is it because she doesn't like me?

38:33.500 --> 38:37.500
No! The Trio must attain
immortality before they turn 30

38:38.500 --> 38:43.100
He's going on to 30. I mustn't
let his effort go to naught!

38:45.300 --> 38:49.500
Mother wants me to get a wife
before I'm 30. I'm turning 30

38:49.500 --> 38:53.500
And my dream girl is right before me.
Why don't I grab this chance?

38:58.100 --> 39:00.500
Do you have something to say to me?

39:00.500 --> 39:03.100
Indeed I do

39:04.100 --> 39:05.500
Say it then

39:06.500 --> 39:09.500
Do you notice
there are many rocks here?

39:14.500 --> 39:20.500
That means this is a huge mountain,
and a rocky mountain at that

39:21.500 --> 39:22.500
And then?

39:23.500 --> 39:26.500
Rocky mountains are unlike
other mountains

39:26.500 --> 39:29.500
Other mountains are
covered with plants

39:29.500 --> 39:34.100
But this mountain is bare.
Isn't it rare?

39:35.500 --> 39:39.500
It's indeed rare, right?
That's why I must take a closer look

39:41.300 --> 39:43.300
No talking during meditation!

39:46.300 --> 39:48.300
Can I ask another question?

39:50.500 --> 39:56.500
By meditating here, will we not be
hungry even if we go without food?

40:01.500 --> 40:03.500
Whose stomach is rumbling?

40:04.500 --> 40:07.300
I told you one can't do without food

40:09.500 --> 40:11.500
Oh no! We must get out of here!

40:11.500 --> 40:14.500
-Where to?
-Into that cave!

40:14.500 --> 40:15.500
To eat?

40:35.500 --> 40:38.500
Uncle, can I make a deal with you?

40:39.500 --> 40:46.100
I'll give you my camel
in exchange for food and a bath

40:46.100 --> 40:47.500
Sure

40:50.500 --> 40:53.300
-Have some water
-Thanks

40:53.500 --> 40:57.100
-Here are the noodles
-Thanks

41:03.500 --> 41:07.500
Slowly.
You must've run into bandits

41:08.500 --> 41:12.500
It's a long story. We were on our way
to the Capital to "miansheng"...

41:12.500 --> 41:14.300
Miansheng?

41:14.500 --> 41:19.300
I mean we come from Miansheng.
We were planning to go to the Capital

41:21.500 --> 41:27.500
Eat slowly.
Don't choke

41:32.500 --> 41:35.100
Aren't you fit, sir!

41:35.500 --> 41:37.500
Guess how old I am

41:38.500 --> 41:41.100
Around 60 or 70?

41:41.500 --> 41:48.100
That was a long time ago!
I'm now 120 years old!

41:52.500 --> 41:53.900
Surely not?

41:54.500 --> 41:57.500
Where are all the young people
in your village?

41:57.500 --> 42:02.100
There aren't any.
The youngest is over 80 years old

42:12.500 --> 42:16.500
-I know you!
-Who are you?

42:16.500 --> 42:18.500
-Come with me!
-Where to?

42:18.500 --> 42:20.100
Come on!

42:25.500 --> 42:27.100
Come on!

42:28.500 --> 42:30.500
You ran so fast!

42:31.500 --> 42:33.500
What sound was that?

42:33.500 --> 42:35.500
Come on, there isn't anybody around

42:42.500 --> 42:45.500
Look! "A traveller returning from
the world only to roam the world again"

42:45.500 --> 42:47.500
Lower your voice!

42:47.500 --> 42:50.500
-Lu and the Princess were here!
-Not so loud!

42:50.500 --> 42:52.500
Lu might be inside.
Lu!

42:52.500 --> 42:53.500
Shhh!

43:12.500 --> 43:16.100
-What is it?
-The furnace!

43:16.500 --> 43:18.500
That's really it?

43:19.500 --> 43:21.500
Open it up and see

43:38.100 --> 43:40.100
"Manual Of Deity Of Medicine"?

43:41.500 --> 43:44.500
This book has been lost for years!

43:44.500 --> 43:48.500
It explains, treats and cures diseases
based on the five elements

43:48.500 --> 43:51.500
That means it can cure
all kinds of diseases?

43:51.500 --> 43:54.500
There's hope for the people
in Ping'an Town!

43:54.500 --> 43:55.500
Great!

44:04.500 --> 44:06.500
Is it an earthquake?

44:11.500 --> 44:13.100
Let's get out of here!

44:15.300 --> 44:16.300
Run!

44:30.500 --> 44:31.500
Subtitled by Transtar Media Services
